ngers perform on The Ed Sullivan Show: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MIIU9xkGAMs&list=PLQWND5qZhbj1fSTRzLrpV3vLO1yOGx8vH\n\nSign up to receive the Ed Sullivan Show newsletter! https://EdSullivan.lnk.to/SubscribeToEmail\n\nFollow The Ed Sullivan Show:\nWebsite http://edsullivan.com/\nFacebook https://facebook.com/EdSullivanShow\nTwitter https://twitter.com/EdSullivanShow\nInstagram https://instagram.com/theedsullivanshow/\nTikTok: https://www.tiktok.com/@theedsullivanshow\n\nThe Ed Sullivan Show was a television variety program that aired on CBS from 1948-1971. For 23 years it aired every Sunday night and played host to the world's greatest talents. The Ed Sullivan Show is well known for bringing rock n' roll music to the forefront of American culture through acts like Elvis Presley, The Beatles, and The Rolling Stones. The entertainers each week ranged from comedians like Joan Rivers and Rodney Dangerfield, to Broadway stars Julie Andrews and Richard Burton, to pop singers such as Bobby Darin and Petula Clark. It also frequently featured stars of Motown such as The Supremes, The Temptations, Stevie Wonder and The Jackson 5. The Ed Sullivan Show was one of the only places on American television where such a wide variety of popular culture was showcased and its legacy lives on to this day.\n\n© SOFA Entertainment. All Rights Reserved.\n\n#Carpenters #EdSullivan #EdSullivanShow", "channel_id": "UCDUNe-NZaknJOGyulc4Ohvg", "channel_url": "https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDUNe-NZaknJOGyulc4Ohvg", "duration": 177, "view_count": 1698230, "age_limit": 0, "webpage_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9hJCr9cq5co", "categories": ["Music"], "tags": ["ed sullivan", "ed sullivan show", "ed sullivan youtube channel", "carpenters", "carpenters close to you", "carpenters they long to be close to you", "they long to be close to you", "they long to be close to you carpenters", "karen carpenter", "richard carpenter", "70s pop", "pop", "70s hits", "70s pop hits", "carpenters ed sul